# npm's packlist reads this file *instead of* .gitignore in this directory, and the root
# `files` whitelist does not override either. .gitignore here ignores `dist/` (it is build
# output), but the published tarball IS the runnable board — it must carry the built
# frontend, or `npx meerkat-taskpanel` would install an API-only server.
#
# Keep this file so web/dist survives `npm pack`, and do not ignore `dist` in it.
# test/verify/pack-manifest.test.mjs pins both halves. See docs/ops/publishing.md §2.
